            M225,284 H331 A9,9 0 0 1 331,302 H225 A9,9 0 0 1 225,284 Z
            M180,346 H190 A8,8 0 0 1 198,354 V364 A8,8 0 0 1 190,372 H180 A8,8 0 0 1 172,364 V354 A8,8 0 0 1 180,346 Z
            M225,350 H291 A9,9 0 0 1 291,368 H225 A9,9 0 0 1 225,350 Z" />
